# The port's half of the kaon- like-for-like; its partner is kaon_minus_emonly.mac.
#
# MEASURED, 500,000 events. CLOSED - docs/RISK.md V46.
#
#                     port BEFORE         port AFTER          Geant4 EM-only      after
#   kaon-  1239.62 +/- 1.303   1132.65 +/- 1.199   1131.87 +/- 1.195   +0.069%, 0.46 sigma
#   kaon+  1242.97 +/- 1.306   1242.97 +/- 1.306   1240.74 +/- 1.302   +0.18%,  1.21 sigma
#
# "BEFORE" was +9.52% at 61.0 sigma - the largest disagreement in the whole EM chain and now
# the smallest. The kaon+ column is bit-identical across the fix.
#
# The port's own two kaons now differ by 9.74% where Geant4's differ by 9.62%, against 0.270%
# before. The kaon is the extreme case of V46 because beta is 0.703 at 200 MeV: the mechanism
# is a chord across a convex R(E) and the chord error goes as the curvature, so the ordering
# mu < pi < K is the ordering of 1/beta. See kaon_minus_emonly.mac and docs/RISK.md V46.

/run/initialize
/control/verbose 0
/run/verbose 1

/gun/particle kaon-
/gun/energy 200 MeV

/run/printProgress 100000
/run/beamOn 500000
